OL,3,GNEWSASingle guilty verdict in Palestine
OL,4,AAction trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury has been discharged after
OL,7,Freaching a single guilty verdict in the
OL,8,Ftrial of eight Palestine Action
OL,9,Factivists who were accused of helping
OL,10,Fto organise a raid on the UK site of an
OL,11,FIsrael-based defence firm
OL,13,FThe jury at the Old Bailey spent more
OL,14,Fthan 37 hours considering evidence, but
OL,15,Ffailed to reach verdicts on 14 of 15
OL,16,Fcharges relating to the raid at the
OL,17,FElbit Systems Ltd factory in Filton,
OL,18,Fnear Bristol, in August 2024.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
