OL,3,GNEWSASingle guilty verdict in Palestine
OL,4,AAction trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne guilty verdict, for criminal
OL,7,Fdamage, was passed on Tuesday, but the
OL,8,Fdefendant cannot be named for legal
OL,9,Freasons.
OL,11,FProsecutors will now consider seeking a
OL,12,Fretrial for the unresolved charges -
OL,13,Fbut any trial could be a year away due
OL,14,Fto backlogs in the Crown Courts.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
